[Title: 奏（かなで）]
[Title: Kanade]

138
00:23:49,772 --> 00:23:58,772
[Text: 作詞・作曲：大橋卓弥 / 常田真太郎]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: Takuya Ohashi / Shintaro Tsuneta]

139
00:24:02,572 --> 00:24:07,772
改札の前 つなぐ手と手 いつものざわめき 新しい風
The hands linked in front of the ticket gate, the usual hustle and bustle, a new breeze.

140
00:24:14,572 --> 00:24:19,772
明るく見送るはずだったのに うまく笑えずに君を見ていた
Even though I was supposed to see you off cheerfully, I looked at you without being able to smile well.

141
00:24:28,072 --> 00:24:38,772
君が大人になってくその季節が 悲しい歌で溢れないように
So that the season when you grow into an adult won't be filled with sad songs.

142
00:24:39,772 --> 00:24:49,272
最後に何か君に伝えたくて 「さよなら」に代わる言葉を 僕は探してた
Wanting to tell you something at the very end, I was searching for words to replace "goodbye".

143
00:24:58,472 --> 00:25:01,159
君の手を引く
Pulling your hand...

144
00:25:10,937 --> 00:25:16,037
君の手を引くその役目が
The role of leading your hand...

145
00:25:16,487 --> 00:25:23,187
僕の使命だなんて そう思ってた
I honestly believed it was my mission.

146
00:25:30,687 --> 00:25:36,337
だけど今わかったんだ 僕らならもう
But now I realize, for the two of us,

147
00:25:36,887 --> 00:25:42,237
重ねた日々が ほら
Look, the days we've shared together

148
00:25:42,687 --> 00:26:52,387
導いてくれる
Will guide us forward.

149
00:26:19,687 --> 00:26:25,487
突然ふいに鳴り響くベルの音
The sudden ringing of a bell...

150
00:26:25,737 --> 00:26:32,237
焦る僕 解ける手 離れてく君
My panicking self, hands unclasping, you pulling away.

151
00:26:33,287 --> 00:26:37,687
夢中で呼び止めて 抱きしめたんだ
I called out to you frantically and held you tight.

152
00:26:37,887 --> 00:26:44,237
君がどこに行ったって 僕の声で守るよ
No matter where you go, I will protect you with my voice.

153
00:26:48,187 --> 00:26:54,187
君が僕の前に現れた日から
Ever since the day you appeared before me,

154
00:26:54,887 --> 00:27:01,237
何もかもが違くみえたんだ
Everything looked different than before.

155
00:27:02,237 --> 00:27:07,387
朝も光も涙も歌う声も
The morning, the light, tears, and singing voices—

156
00:27:07,587 --> 00:27:13,237
君が輝きをくれたんだ
You gave them all their brilliance.

157
00:27:13,887 --> 00:27:19,237
抑えきれない思いをこの声に乗せて
Putting my overflowing feelings into this voice,

158
00:27:20,337 --> 00:27:25,387
遠く君の街へ届けよう
I'll send them far to your town.

159
00:27:26,437 --> 00:27:31,237
たとえばそれがこんな歌だったら
Even if it's a song like this,

160
00:27:31,687 --> 00:27:37,237
僕らは何処にいたとしてもつながっていける
No matter where we are, we can stay connected.

161
00:27:47,687 --> 00:27:52,237
ななななな…
Na na na...

162
00:27:57,087 --> 00:28:02,237
ああ…
Ah...

163
00:28:51,687 --> 00:28:56,687
[Title: No title] [Text: 作詞・作曲:Reol]
[Title: No title] [Text: Words & Music: Reol]

164
00:28:57,687 --> 00:29:03,037
ずっと夢見てた僕になれたかな とうに帰れないとこまで来たみたい
I wonder if I've become the person I always dreamed of. It seems I've come far beyond the point of return.

165
00:29:03,187 --> 00:29:06,887
自分の足で二段飛ばしてそうもっと先へ 駆けていけるはずだから
Skipping two steps at a time on my own feet, I should be able to run even further ahead.

166
00:29:07,387 --> 00:29:11,387
深くなる傷を縫い付け 繋ぐパス軸に廻りだす
Sewing up deepening wounds, revolving around the connecting path axis.

167
00:29:11,887 --> 00:29:16,887
慣れた痛み、焦る呼吸とビート 気付かないふりしてまた一人
Familiar pain, hurried breathing and beats, pretending not to notice as I'm alone again.

168
00:29:17,387 --> 00:29:20,887
何が正当？ないな永劫 誰が間違った対価払うの
What is legitimate? There is no eternity. Who pays the price for being wrong?

169
00:29:21,387 --> 00:29:26,087
あんたが嫌いなあいつはきっと ただ「それだけ」で不正解なんだ
The person you hate is surely deemed incorrect for just that reason alone.

170
00:29:26,387 --> 00:29:30,887
０点だって提言したって 全然納得できない理由も
Even if asserted as zero points, the reason I cannot accept it at all...

171
00:29:31,387 --> 00:29:36,887
最前線はいつだってここだった 最善策は最初からなかった 緩やかに崩れ壊れてく
The frontline was always right here. There was never any best plan from the start. Slowly crumbling and breaking down.

172
00:29:41,237 --> 00:29:45,887
ゆるりゆるり首を締めるように 昨日までの僕が殺されていく
As if slowly tightening the noose around my neck, the yesterday me is being killed off.

173
00:29:46,237 --> 00:29:52,887
緩やかに離れ離れ飽く ぐらりんり君にきこえるのは 僕が知らない声になってく
Slowly drifting apart, growing weary, what echoes to you in a dizzy spin becomes a voice I don't even know.

174
00:30:04,784 --> 00:30:07,524
幼い頃から気付いたら傍にいた
Since I was little, before I knew it, you were by my side.

175
00:30:07,524 --> 00:30:10,004
まるで空気のようだ
As if you were the air itself.

176
00:30:10,004 --> 00:30:13,024
僕は君とぎゅっと手を繋いで
I held hands tightly with you,

177
00:30:13,024 --> 00:30:16,124
楽しいことも涙も
sharing both happy moments and tears.

178
00:30:16,124 --> 00:30:19,274
僕は君に話して聞かせた
I told you all about them.

179
00:30:19,274 --> 00:30:22,804
僕を笑う人や貶す声が
Drowning out the people who laughed at me and the voices that put me down,

180
00:30:22,804 --> 00:30:25,854
聞こえぬように君は歌った
you sang so I wouldn't hear them.

181
00:30:25,854 --> 00:30:29,094
この声を君が受信
You received this voice,

182
00:30:29,094 --> 00:30:32,054
使い捨てだっていって腐っても止まらない
even if disposable, even if rotting away, it never stops.

183
00:30:32,054 --> 00:30:35,094
ハイファイ、ツァイトガイスト
Hi-fi, Zeitgeist,

184
00:30:35,094 --> 00:30:38,244
一周巡る間のたった一瞬だけでも
for just a fleeting moment in a full rotation,

185
00:30:38,244 --> 00:30:41,104
交わる鼓動、音、繋ぐ色
our beating hearts, sounds, and connecting colors intersect.

186
00:30:43,264 --> 00:30:48,264
緩やかに崩れ壊れてく
Gently crumbling and breaking apart,

187
