194
00:31:22,724 --> 00:31:27,244
いつか君に届くかな いやそんな日はきっと来ないだろうな
Will I ever reach you? No, a day like that will surely never come.

195
00:31:27,244 --> 00:31:31,354
声も体も持たぬ君に 救われた何億人の一人
Saved by you—who has no voice or body—one of hundreds of millions.

196
00:31:31,354 --> 00:31:34,404
赤青合わせ彩った
Combining red and blue, we colored the world,

197
