好き 嫌い 常識 I don't care 吹っ飛べ BANG!!!
Likes, dislikes, common sense—I don't care, blow it all away with a BANG!

208
00:33:16,122 --> 00:33:22,252
かかってこい Majority あたしに負けはなし ここまでって引かれた そのボーダー 誰のルール？
Come at me, majority! I won't lose. That border drawn up to here—whose rule is it?

209
00:33:22,832 --> 00:33:26,292
あの日乗り越えた weak heart
Overcoming that day's weak heart,

210
00:33:26,292 --> 00:33:29,512
強くなったあたしが笑い飛ばしてあげる ha, ha
the stronger me laughs it all away, ha, ha!

211
00:33:30,232 --> 00:33:33,322
言いたい事は言う やりたくない事はしない
Say what I want to say, don't do what I don't want to do.

212
00:33:33,322 --> 00:33:35,822
悪意気にしない 皆違うの当然だし
Not caring about malice, everyone being different is only natural,

213
00:33:35,822 --> 00:33:40,272
あたしも変わんない ニューノーマルの時代
and I won't change either in this new normal era, everybody say I want to be free!

214
00:33:46,612 --> 00:33:51,672
叶えたい自分 肯定 生きてるんだ あたし
Affirming the self I want to be, I'm alive,

215
00:33:51,672 --> 00:33:53,822
Everybody say I want to live more

216
00:33:54,612 --> 00:33:59,612
ねぇ 生きてるんだ あたし
Hey, I'm truly alive,

217
00:33:59,612 --> 00:34:05,382
歌えや歌え 今を （声上げて）
sing and chant the present moment, raising our voices!

218
00:34:10,012 --> 00:34:15,972
生まれたその時から選んできたんだ 思い出せ あたしはあたしだ
We've chosen our path since the moment we were born—remember, I am who I am!

219
00:34:15,972 --> 00:34:20,232
不可能な事など何一つもない 嘘じゃない なりたい自分に
Nothing is impossible, that's no lie, to become the self I want to be.

220
00:34:20,232 --> 00:34:24,392
好き 嫌い 常識 I don't care 吹っ飛べ BANG!!!
Likes, dislikes, common sense—I don't care, blow it all away with a BANG!

221
