フル１０鳴らす このリリック かます わからす挑発 下向いて舌打ちからの「は？」
Ringing out full blast, dropping these lyrics, provocation to make you understand, looking down and clicking my tongue like 'Huh?'

224
00:34:43,252 --> 00:34:53,222
Excuse me あしからず 倍返し 食らえ パンチライン 聞かせたげる
Excuse me, excuse my rudeness, double revenge—take this punchline and let me make you hear it.

225
00:34:57,022 --> 00:35:00,962
やってから考えな あたしがついてるから Everybody say I want to be free
Think about it after you try, because I've got your back—everybody say I want to be free!

226
00:36:37,203 --> 00:36:42,383
[Title: ローリンガール]
[Title: Rollin' Girl]

227
00:36:37,983 --> 00:36:42,383
[Text: 作詞・作曲: wowaka]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: wowaka]

228
00:36:52,163 --> 00:36:58,763
ロンリーガールはいつまでも届かない夢見て
Lonely girl, dreaming of a dream that will never reach...

229
00:36:58,903 --> 00:37:04,223
騒ぐ頭の中を掻き回して、掻き回して
...stirring up and stirring up her buzzing head...

230
00:37:21,263 --> 00:37:24,903
「問題ない。」と呟いて、言葉は失われた？
Murmuring "No problem," were her words lost?

231
00:37:25,043 --> 00:37:30,323
もう失敗、もう失敗
Another failure, another failure...

232
00:37:30,583 --> 00:37:34,063
間違い探しに終われば、また、回るの
Once she finishes spot-the-mistake, she spins again...

233
00:37:34,183 --> 00:37:39,123
もう一回、もう一回
One more time, one more time...

234
00:37:40,183 --> 00:37:45,183
「私は今日も転がります。」と
Saying "I'll roll again today,"

235
00:37:46,003 --> 00:37:50,143
少女は言う 少女は言う 言葉に意味を奏でながら！
The girl says, the girl says, playing meaning into her words!

236
00:37:50,843 --> 00:37:55,883
「もう良いかい？」「まだですよ、まだまだ先は見えないので。息を止めるの、今。」
"Are you ready?" "Not yet, the end is still far out of sight. Hold your breath, right now."

237
00:38:10,523 --> 00:38:14,903
ローリンガールの成れの果て 届かない、向こうの色
The end result of a rollin' girl, the unreachable colors on the other side...

238
00:38:15,083 --> 00:38:19,763
重なる声と声を混ぜあわせて、混ぜあわせて
...mixing and blending overlapping voices together.

239
00:38:24,583 --> 00:38:29,183
「問題ない。」と呟いた言葉は失われた
Words muttered as "No problem" were lost...

240
00:38:30,043 --> 00:38:34,063
どうなったって良いんだってさ
"It doesn't matter how it turns out,"

241
00:38:34,183 --> 00:38:39,123
間違いだって起こしちゃおうと誘う、坂道
Coaxing mistakes on this sloping road...

242
00:38:39,683 --> 00:38:43,883
もう一回、もう一回私をどうか転がしてと
One more time, one more time, asking to be rolled along...

243
00:38:44,043 --> 00:38:48,983
少女は言う 少女は言う 無口に意味を重ねながら！
The girl says, the girl says, piling meaning onto her silence!

244
00:38:49,683 --> 00:38:54,083
「もう良いかい？」「もう少し、もうすぐ何か見えるだろうと。息を止めるの、今。」
"Are you ready?" "Just a bit more, something will soon be visible. Hold your breath, right now."

245
00:38:54,843 --> 00:38:58,983
もう一回、もう一回「私は今日も転がります。」と
One more time, one more time, saying "I'll roll again today!"

246
00:38:59,583 --> 00:39:04,383
少女は言う 少女は言う 言葉に笑みを奏でながら！
The girl says, the girl says, playing smiles into her words!

247
00:39:04,843 --> 00:39:09,063
「もう良いかい？もう良いよ。そろそろ君も疲れたろう、ね。」
"Are you ready? Yes, you're ready. You must be tired by now, right?"

248
00:39:09,783 --> 00:39:14,083
息を止めるの、今
Hold your breath, right now.

249
00:39:14,803 --> 00:39:19,083
もう一回、もう一回「私は今日も転がります。」と
One more time, one more time, saying "I'll roll again today!"

250
00:39:19,683 --> 00:39:24,463
少女は言う 少女は言う 言葉に笑みを奏でながら！
The girl says, the girl says, playing smiles into her words!

251
00:39:24,883 --> 00:39:29,083
「もう良いかい？もう良いよ。そろそろ君も疲れたろう、ね。」 息を止めるの、今
"Are you ready? Yes, you're ready. You must be tired by now, right? Hold your breath, right now."

